<item>
  <title>Laila Dabab Nahas</title>
  <link>https://ddi-talent.github.io/people/laila-dabab-nahas/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 






<section id="background" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="background">Background</h2>
<p>Laila has a bachelor and MSc in biotechnology, and a PhD and postdoctoral in bioinformatics.</p>
</section>
<section id="current-job" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="current-job">Current job</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.research.ed.ac.uk/en/persons/laila-dabab-nahas/">Teaching assistant</a> in Edinburgh Medical School</p>
</section>
<section id="experience" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="experience">Experience</h2>
<ul>
<li><p><a href="https://information-services.ed.ac.uk/research-support/research-computing/ecdf/high-performance-computing">High performance computers (Eddie)</a></p></li>
<li><p>Programming languages: Shell, R, SQL, NLP, Python</p></li>
<li><p>Websites development</p></li>
<li><p><a href="https://github.com/LailaNh">GitHub</a></p></li>
<li><p>Analysis such as scRNA, RNA and HiC.</p></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="courses-for-ug-and-pgt" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="courses-for-ug-and-pgt">Courses for UG and PGT</h2>
<ul>
<li><p>Data Sciences for Health and Social Care</p></li>
<li><p>Foundational and Applied Research Design courses</p></li>
<li><p>Introduction to Databases and information systems</p></li>
<li><p>Natural Language Processing (NLP) in Health and Social Care</p></li>
<li><p>Foundations of software development in Health and Social Care</p></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="cpd" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="cpd">CPD</h2>
<ul>
<li><p>AFHEA</p></li>
<li><p>PGCap in progress ..</p></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="cool-ideas" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="cool-ideas">Cool ideas</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.thinglink.com/view/scene/2020543706418905956">Escape room</a> for teaching in Foundational Research Design</p>
</section>
<section id="research-and-supervision" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="research-and-supervision">Research and supervision</h2>
<ul>
<li><p>Co-supervising a GWAS project for PG with Dr.&nbsp;Kristin Nicodemus</p></li>
<li><p>Co-supervising a SLICC project with Dr.&nbsp;Nadege Atkins</p></li>
<li><p>A mentor in <a href="https://global.ed.ac.uk/education-beyond-borders">Education Beyond Borders programme</a> at The University of Edinburgh</p></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="publications" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="publications">Publications</h2>
<p><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=ulTslo4AAAAJ&amp;hl=en">Laila Dabab Nahas - Google Scholar</a></p>
<p>Participating in two chapters in a coming book</p>
</section>
<section id="outside-work" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="outside-work">Outside work</h2>
<ul>
<li><p>A very proud mother</p></li>
<li><p>Manges here own small business, <a href="https://ibn-battuta.co.uk/Eng.html">Ibn Battuta Arabic online centre</a> for teaching Arabic for children and adults</p></li>
<li><p>Volunteers in <a href="https://homestarteastlothian.co.uk/">Home-Start East Lothian</a></p></li>
<li><p>Started to learned playing piano recently!</p></li>
<li><p>Loves reading books (such as “Atomic Habits” by James Clark and “That little sound in your head” by Mo Gawdat) and socializing</p></li>
<li><p>Loves to learn new things</p></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="contact-details" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="contact-details">Contact details</h2>
<p>📧 <a href="mailto://Laila.Dabab.Nahas@ed.ac.uk">Laila.Dabab.Nahas@ed.ac.uk</a></p>
<p>🔗 <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lailadababnahas/">LinkedIn</a></p>


</section>

 ]]></description>
